## CQ-JC-02 | the 5 Abnormals Delight foods show in JEI and the creative tab; escargot and maple cookie do not
@group client
@commands JEI search `maple glazed`, `cherry cookie`, `duck fillet`, `duck noodles`, `escargot`, `maple cookie`; creative mode (with `[creative_menu] disabled = false`): Farmer's Delight tab and the search tab
@pass Maple Glazed Bacon, Cherry Cookie, Duck Fillet, Cooked Duck Fillet, Duck Noodles are in JEI with their recipes (R and U) and in the Farmer's Delight tab and creative search; Escargot and Maple Cookie are in neither
@fails `ItemOrphanTabMixin` not applied on the client; JEI caches its list: restart the client, not F3+T
look hand: JEI and creative tab show the five, not escargot or maple cookie

