@fails `merges_oceansdelight.json` not read (SwapLists: requires `oceansdelight`, `hostiledelight`); merge recipe swap left a duplicate smelting recipe for the fillet
> cdevtest rdetail guardianfillet_from_guardian_shell
> cdevtest rdetail cooked_guardian_tail
